# Builds the benchmark for each dispatcher and runs them interleaved, three
# reps: haxe bench/all.hxml [cpp] [jvm] [node]
# Run from the repository's root. CROSSBYTE_SRC and GRAPHAXE_SRC name the
# src folders of CrossByte and Graphaxe to compare with; msignal, tink_core,
# hxsignal and signals join where haxelib finds them (HAXELIB_PATH).
-cp bench
--run RunBench
